### Archivo para la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (también sirve de referencia para Postman)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@access = pegar_accessToken_aca
@refresh = pegar_refreshToken_aca
@token = pegar_token_del_email_aca
@userId = pegar_id_aca

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Registro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan@mail.com",
  "password": "Clave1234",
  "confirmPassword": "Clave1234"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "juan@mail.com", "password": "Clave1234" }

### user actual
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Renovar tokens
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Logout (invalida todas las sesiones)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Verificar email (el token llega por mail / consola)
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{token}}" }

### Reenviar verificación
POST {{base}}/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "juan@mail.com" }

### Olvidé mi contraseña
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "juan@mail.com" }

### Restablecer contraseña
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{token}}", "password": "Nueva1234", "confirmPassword": "Nueva1234" }

### Cambiar contraseña (logueado)
PATCH {{base}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Clave1234", "newPassword": "Otra1234", "confirmPassword": "Otra1234" }

### Actualizar mi perfil
PATCH {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Juan Carlos" }

### [ADMIN] Listar users
GET {{base}}/users?page=1&limit=10&search=juan
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [ADMIN] Ver user
GET {{base}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [ADMIN] Cambiar rol
PATCH {{base}}/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "admin" }

### [ADMIN] Activar / desactivar
PATCH {{base}}/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### [ADMIN] Eliminar
DELETE {{base}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
